1
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
The station closes before midnight.

2
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:17,400
Then we should leave now.

3
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:23,000
Did you bring the map?

4
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:31,000
It is in the blue case.

5
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:38,000
Keep your voice down.

6
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:47,000
Someone is outside.

7
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:55,000
The hallway is empty.

8
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:04,600
Check the second door.

9
00:01:12,100 --> 00:01:14,000
This lock is new.

10
00:01:22,700 --> 00:01:24,900
Use the smaller key.

11
00:01:33,900 --> 00:01:36,000
That was not here yesterday.

12
00:01:45,800 --> 00:01:48,000
Take a picture of it.

13
00:01:58,400 --> 00:02:00,500
The signal is gone.

14
00:02:11,700 --> 00:02:14,000
We can send it from the roof.

15
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:27,800
Wait, I heard the elevator.

16
00:02:39,900 --> 00:02:42,000
Hide behind the cabinet.

17
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:57,000
They passed us.

18
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:12,400
We only have ten minutes.

19
00:03:26,100 --> 00:03:28,000
The stairs are blocked.

20
00:03:42,500 --> 00:03:44,800
There is another route.

21
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:01,500
Follow the red cable.

22
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:19,000
The control room is ahead.

23
00:04:34,700 --> 00:04:37,000
Do not touch the alarm.

24
00:04:53,100 --> 00:04:55,000
I found the main switch.
